The Original question was:
==========================

Hi all,
 	
I have freshly installed V5.1B  and have a problem with the 
Application Manager on the CDE control panel unable to find 
the correct path to the Desktop APPS Group directory.
( ie: It cant find /var/dt/appconfig/appmanager/user-hostname-0 ).

The same problem exists for the Filemanager.

I get the error "invalid folder specification -
   /var/cluster/members/{memb}/dt/appconfig/appmanager/user-hostname-0 " 

I have checked all of the links down the path and all are correct
compared with a working system.  The problem seems to be in
translating ( or not translating ) the {memb} link.

dtappgather and dtsearchpath build the path to the Applications
Group for each user at login and this doesn't seem to be working
correctly.

Any help would be appreciated.
  
