Hi all--

This may be a newbie question but I'll throw it out anyway. I saw=20
something odd on one of our ES45 5.1B HSG80 servers last night:

1. I began unzipping a large file (Oracle export file) in a directory,=20
running in the background.
2. I attempted an 'ls' of the directory where the unzip was running.
3. The ls did not return until the unzip had completed.

This caused me to wonder (a) if others have seen this, (b) under what=20
other circumstances it happens, and (c) there's something at the file=20
system or AdvFS level (e.g. sysconfigdb changes) we can do about it.

